  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Illicit Financial Flow Dashboard</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- Civil society organisations 
2- Media
3- Policy-makers
4- Academics and researchers</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1- To generate new data on Illicit Financial Flows to strengthen future research and/or inform policy making. 
2- To raise awareness of the scale and risks of illicit financial flows across countries and sectors amongst civil society, media, academics and policy-makers</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project delivers a multi-pronged approach to the assessment of the vulnerability of jurisdictions to different types and sources of IFFs through undertaking targeted research whose results will be shared in a Global Dashboard of Illicit Finance Vulnerabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
